1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
3 times a puppy MUST go out. Most people miss #2.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
1. Right after waking up. Morning, and after every nap.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
2. Five to thirty minutes after eating or drinking. Set a timer.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
3. During and right after play.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The full schedule is on one page: a sample day, hour by hour.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
And a printable potty log, so you see the pattern instead of guessing.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
It's part of a 30-day plan: one short session a day, already mapped out.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
30-Day Puppy Training Plan. Link in bio.
